@api = http://localhost:5080
@email = demo@holograma3d.local
@password = Demo-1234
# Cambia estas rutas por un .stl y un .glb tuyos (barras normales).
@stl = C:/ruta/a/modelo.stl
@glb = C:/ruta/a/modelo.glb

### Registro
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login: devuelve accessToken (30 min) y refreshToken (7 días)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Usuario actual
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Renovar tokens
# @name refresh
POST {{api}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}" }

### Subir un STL (máx. 50 MB); name es opcional
# @name stl
POST {{api}}/api/models
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=holograma

--holograma
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Mi modelo STL
--holograma
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="modelo.stl"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< {{stl}}
--holograma--

### Subir un GLB
# @name glb
POST {{api}}/api/models
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=holograma

--holograma
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="modelo.glb"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< {{glb}}
--holograma--

### Mis modelos (el más reciente primero)
GET {{api}}/api/models
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Un modelo
GET {{api}}/api/models/{{stl.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Descargar el archivo
GET {{api}}/api/models/{{glb.response.body.$.id}}/file
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Borrar
DELETE {{api}}/api/models/{{stl.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Cerrar sesión en todos los dispositivos: ningún refresh token anterior vuelve a servir
POST {{api}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
